motanka-qt6 (0.1.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial package: Qt 6.10.2 (qtbase, qtshadertools, qtsvg, qtdeclarative,
    qtwayland) under /opt/motanka for Ubuntu 24.04, built with GCC 16.
  * Qt 6.12.0 for both Ubuntu 24.04 and 26.04: Upstream's shell needs Qt
    6.11 or later, and both archives carry 6.10. On 26.04 it uses the
    archive's GCC 16 and C++ runtime.
  * Add qtimageformats (WebP, TIFF, ICNS, TGA and WBMP plugins).

